          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-center text-sm leading-7 text-slate">
            Have a SAP transformation, integration or delivery challenge? I would be glad to hear about it.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]">
            <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-[#e6f1ff]">Contact details</h3>
              <dl class="mt-5 space-y-5 text-sm">
                <div><dt class="mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate">Email</dt><dd class="mt-1"><a class="break-all text-cyan hover:underline" href="mailto:nguyenntk0703@gmail.com">nguyenntk0703@gmail.com</a></dd></div>
                <div><dt class="mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate">Phone</dt><dd class="mt-1"><a class="text-[#d6def2] hover:text-cyan" href="tel:+84935868595">+84-935-868-595</a></dd></div>
